362
00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:47.460
[Oden]
And on the day
we reached that island,

363
00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:50.210
[ODEN]
And on the day
we reached that island,

364
00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:50.240
we uncovered the entire
