00:19:57.910 --> 00:19:58.680
[Oden]
We learned of
the one-hundred-year void.

367
00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:00.660
We learned of the 100-Year Void.

368
00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:01.230
We learned of the
people of the "D,"

369
00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:03.120
We learned of the
"People of the D.,"

370
00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.460
and of the ancient weapons.

371
00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:05.520
Tales from a time
when the Land of Wano

372
00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:07.750
Tales from a time when the Land
