374
00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:16.220
[Oden]
And in the face of the treasure,

375
00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:18.300
And in the face of the treasure,

376
00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.350
there was one thing
I remember most.

377
00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:21.980
All I could hear was Roger.

378
00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:22.200
[OMUSUBI]
"All I could hear was Roger.

379
00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:25.650
All I could hear was Roger.
He just laughed.

380
00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:28.320
He just laughed.

381
00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:30.650
So did we all.

382
00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:35.570
On and on until tears
fell from our eyes.

383
00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:50.710
Oh, Joyboy. Amazing!

384
00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:54.720
I wish that I could have lived
in the same era as you!

385
00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:56.640
[laughs]

386
00:20:56.640 --> 00:21:00.260
This is quite the treasure
